\par 1. \cf0   Honour be to God,
\par \pard\li144\sl190\slmult0   who created us in His image
\par    And always He takes care of us all
\par   Honour be to God
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6  Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  He is kind to all mankind
\par   and His power in abundance
\par   ://: Give Honour to our Great God. ://:\tab 
\par 
\par \pard\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  2.   Let's give thanks to God
\par \pard\li144\sl190\slmult0   He is the creator of all things
\par   in His wisdom and all in His power
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6   Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Let's give thanks to Him
\par \pard\li180\sl190\slmult0  There is none as counsellor
\par   in the realm of creation
\par  ://:Praise to the name of the Lord. ://:
\par 
\par \pard\fi-180\li180\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3.    Lord is Almighty,
\par \pard\li180\sl190\slmult0\qj   There is no one on earth just like Him.
\par   And the strength of satan has vanquished,
\par  Lord is Almighty.
\par \pard\li180\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6  Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par \pard\li180\sl190\slmult0\qj Come to Him all ye people
\par  come with praise to Jehovah!
\par \pard  ://:All praises to our Great Lord. ://:\f1 
